# EduBotics: upstream LeRobot uses Git LFS for test fixtures/media (*.mp4,
# *.safetensors, *.stl, *.arrow, *.memmap, *.bag, tests/artifacts/cameras/*.png).
# Those files are NOT vendored here (EduBotics uses only src/ + pyproject.toml;
# the Docker build re-clones LeRobot fresh), and this repo's transport workflow
# does not use Git LFS — so the filter=lfs rules are removed to avoid the
# GitHub LFS pre-receive hook rejecting pushes.
*.json !text !filter !merge !diff
